<title>USA: Delta Air sees Q4 unit costs higher than Q3.</title>
<headline>Delta Air sees Q4 unit costs higher than Q3.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delta Air Lines Inc said Friday it expects its fourth quarter unit costs, or costs per available seat mile (CASMs), to increase 5.8 percent over the third quarter.</p>
<p>Delta, the nation's third largest largest carrier, also said it expects available seat miles (ASMs) for the fourth quarter ending in June to increase 2.9 percent over the third quarter ended in March.</p>
</text>
